# Build context for backend/Dockerfile, which is the REPO ROOT (the backend is
# a workspace member and depends on crates/scoreboard-wire by path). Allowlist,
# so the frontend, firmware, data/ and every local artifact stay out by default
# — the repo is far larger than the image needs.
#
# fly.toml / fly.staging.toml name this file via `[build] ignorefile`; BuildKit
# also picks it up automatically for a local `docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .`
# because of the `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` convention. NOTE: .gitignore does
# NOT apply to docker contexts — the re-exclusions at the bottom are what keep
# local secrets and build output out of the image.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/**
!backend/Cargo.toml
!backend/src/**
!backend/config/**
# The OTA image directory is COPYed whole and may legitimately be empty, so the
# directory itself is re-included alongside its contents.
!backend/app_dist
!backend/app_dist/**

**/target/
backend/.maxmind-key
backend/config/local.toml
backend/config/local.toml.example
**/*.md
